Notebook[{

Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell["Forma can\[OAcute]nica del grafo de transici\[OAcute]n en GPU (CUDA)", \
"Title",ExpressionUUID->"444cd77e-6435-4c73-b20f-f4b934d89826"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Clasificaci\[OAcute]n de las reglas ECA por la forma can\[OAcute]nica de su \
grafo de transici\[OAcute]n en espacios peri\[OAcute]dicos de ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       StyleBox["n", "TI"], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> "n", 
     "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "8c4e35eb-663b-43c7-80d4-ef526e4e3c72"],
 " c\[EAcute]lulas, para ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         StyleBox["n", "TI"], "\[LongEqual]", "1", ",", "\[Ellipsis]", ",", 
         "29"}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "n = 1, \\dots, 29", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "103b8026-36de-4dac-b546-bd2321882003"],
 ". Se usa una regla por clase de inverso + espejo (88 reglas): las reglas de \
una misma clase tienen grafos isomorfos, as\[IAcute] que el n\[UAcute]mero de \
formas can\[OAcute]nicas distintas es el mismo que con las 256. "
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"d365992b-34f8-4dd3-9b2d-de98f70b64a0"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["M\[EAcute]todo", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"bb4a83a0-6e6f-40cc-9403-e4fc416c3276"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Es el mismo proceso de la secci\[OAcute]n ",
 StyleBox["Isomorfismo y forma can\[OAcute]nica",
  FontSlant->Italic],
 " del paper, adaptado a la GPU:"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"64506cef-44f4-414b-816f-d84b43587e54"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "1. ",
 StyleBox["Sucesores (GPU).",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 " Un hilo por configuraci\[OAcute]n; la regla se aplica con operaciones de \
bits sobre la palabra de ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       StyleBox["n", "TI"], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> "n", 
     "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "ecea29ec-3877-4163-989a-dfcc4ebd36ae"],
 " bits."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"f3fc4d93-57be-4b5a-b191-fea05679724e"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "2. ",
 StyleBox["Grado de entrada (GPU).",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 " Con ",
 Cell[BoxData[Cell["Compile`AtomicUpdate",
   Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"cb79363b-0bd0-4ed4-baf9-a7d0a9b9cfff"]], 
  "InlineCode",ExpressionUUID->"e5769c47-a588-4289-874d-8dc1395e7589"],
 " (suma at\[OAcute]mica)."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"02ac4c08-958d-4e16-93ed-63b973b5722e"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "3. ",
 StyleBox["Poda desde los Jard\[IAcute]n del Ed\[EAcute]n (GPU).",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 " Cola de Kahn por niveles. El c\[OAcute]digo de cada nodo es un hash de 64 \
bits del multiconjunto de los c\[OAcute]digos de sus predecesores: cada hijo \
suma ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         StyleBox["G", "TI"], "(", 
         StyleBox["h", "TI"], ")"}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, 
     "input" -> "G(h)", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "46fd6bc0-5541-4bdd-b2ef-9dd0464c8c3d"],
 " de forma at\[OAcute]mica al acumulador del padre, y el c\[OAcute]digo del \
padre es ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         StyleBox["F", "TI"], "(", "acumulador", ")"}], TraditionalForm], 
     "errors" -> {}, "input" -> "F(\\text{acumulador})", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "8243f01e-b96f-4980-97f7-73c7bacfb3d0"],
 " (splitmix64). La suma es conmutativa, as\[IAcute] que el c\[OAcute]digo no \
depende de las etiquetas, igual que la lista ordenada del paper. Los niveles \
grandes se lanzan con toda la malla; las cadenas largas de niveles peque\
\[NTilde]os las recorre un solo bloque de 1024 hilos sincronizado con ",
 Cell[BoxData[Cell["SynchronizeThreads",
   Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"96b52d04-c834-4735-99ae-0af0cd318b1d"]], 
  "InlineCode",ExpressionUUID->"5f515bbd-c9b8-4187-94b7-5beb5c61ce49"],
 " (",
 Cell[BoxData[Cell["__syncthreads",
   Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"d24d3f0b-93e3-44f4-9f26-f7eeff4cc1a4"]], 
  "InlineCode",ExpressionUUID->"561c422d-b38d-4891-a82a-970483cb194d"],
 ")."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"6bd36c6e-b89d-4c59-9c18-d9c701fee587"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "4. ",
 StyleBox["Ciclos (GPU + CPU compilado).",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 " Los nodos que nunca entraron a la cola son los de los ciclos. La GPU los \
compacta junto con el c\[OAcute]digo del \[AAcute]rbol que cuelga de cada \
uno; en CPU (",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
   "FunctionCompile", "paclet:ref/FunctionCompile", 
    "https://reference.wolfram.com/language/ref/FunctionCompile.html"},
   "TextRefLink",
   DisplayFunction->(TagBox[
     ButtonBox[
      StyleBox[#, ShowStringCharacters -> True, FontFamily -> 
       "Source Sans Pro"], 
      BaseStyle -> {"Link", FontColor -> LightDarkSwitched[
          RGBColor[0.02, 0.286, 0.651], 
          RGBColor[0.2823, 0.6666, 0.949]]}, ButtonData -> #2, ContentPadding -> 
      False], 
     MouseAppearanceTag["LinkHand"]]& )]],ExpressionUUID->
  "272148ec-fe66-44e3-8f52-0e5064121f87"],
 ") cada ciclo se codifica con su rotaci\[OAcute]n lexicogr\[AAcute]ficamente \
m\[IAcute]nima (algoritmo de dos punteros: O(L) en tiempo y O(1) en memoria \
extra). La forma can\[OAcute]nica es la lista ordenada de los c\[OAcute]digos \
de los ciclos."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"99c0115f-029d-496a-afce-0ff737b8acf2"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Validaci\[OAcute]n: para ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         StyleBox["n", "TI"], "\[LongEqual]", "1..10"}], TraditionalForm], 
     "errors" -> {}, "input" -> "n = 1..10", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "e60ae127-b3d1-4287-b24b-9646215021c2"],
 " y las 256 reglas, la partici\[OAcute]n obtenida es id\[EAcute]ntica a la \
de ",
 Cell[BoxData[Cell["CanonFuncGraph",
   Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"15a76210-bb08-46e4-bd64-d8415cd635b6"]], 
  "InlineCode",ExpressionUUID->"9e631680-2abb-4661-a775-d2112c59c195"],
 " (forma can\[OAcute]nica exacta con listas anidadas).",
 StyleBox["L\[IAcute]mite.",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 " La GPU necesita unos 20 bytes por configuraci\[OAcute]n: con 16 GB (RTX \
5080) el m\[AAcute]ximo es ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         StyleBox["n", "TI"], "\[LongEqual]", "29"}], TraditionalForm], 
     "errors" -> {}, "input" -> "n = 29", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "ce427bf9-0a84-4f67-b775-b55e603c82de"],
 " (~11.9 GB); ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         StyleBox["n", "TI"], "\[LongEqual]", "30"}], TraditionalForm], 
     "errors" -> {}, "input" -> "n = 30", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "7c304539-42d8-46bc-a71d-151cf3f8dea5"],
 " requerir\[IAcute]a ~21 GB.",
 StyleBox["Nota sobre la tarjeta.",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 " Mathematica lee la capacidad de c\[OAcute]mputo 12.0 de la RTX 5080 como \
",
 Cell[BoxData[Cell["sm_12",
   Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"1d2848d6-3a7c-4592-aa64-43187d3e45b2"]], 
  "InlineCode",ExpressionUUID->"a9103765-b93d-41fd-926a-bc5e1f3092a0"],
 "; por eso cada kernel se compila con ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"\"\<CUDAArchitecture\>\"", "->", "\"\<sm_120\>\""}]], "InlineWL", 
  "Input",
  ShowAutoStyles->True,
  ShowSyntaxStyles->True,
  LanguageCategory->"Input",
  ShowStringCharacters->True,ExpressionUUID->
  "ff4e8292-5c79-4acb-86c2-f84d72299a80"],
 " expl\[IAcute]cito. "
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"9078392a-9412-44d8-b5cc-0974fbc10e78"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Funciones", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"8ef76261-4bce-4adc-b775-6203fc85f799"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"Constantes", " ", "del", " ", "hash", " ", 
     RowBox[{"(", "splitmix64", ")"}]}], ",", " ", 
    RowBox[{"como", " ", "enteros", " ", "con", " ", "signo"}]}], " ", "*)"}],
   "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"sgn64", "[", "u_", "]"}], ":=", 
     RowBox[{"If", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"u", ">=", 
        RowBox[{"2", "^", "63"}]}], ",", 
       RowBox[{"u", "-", 
        RowBox[{"2", "^", "64"}]}], ",", "u"}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"mixA", ",", "mixB", ",", "kF", ",", "kG", ",", "kC"}], "}"}], "=", 
     RowBox[{"sgn64", " ", "/@", " ", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{
       "16^^bf58476d1ce4e5b9", ",", "16^^94d049bb133111eb", ",", 
        "\[IndentingNewLine]", "    ", "16^^9e3779b97f4a7c15", ",", 
        "16^^d1b54a32d192ed03", ",", "16^^8cb92ba72f3d8dd7"}], "}"}]}]}], 
    ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"cudaSession", "=", 
     RowBox[{"StartExternalSession", "[", "\"\<CUDA\>\"", "]"}]}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"cudaFn", "[", "f_", "]"}], ":=", 
     RowBox[{"ExternalEvaluate", "[", 
      RowBox[{"cudaSession", ",", 
       RowBox[{"ExternalOperation", "[", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<Function\>\"", ",", "f", ",", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<CUDAArchitecture\>\"", "->", "\"\<sm_120\>\""}]}], 
        "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}]}]}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->" In[1]:=",ExpressionUUID->"3826987b-0b11-4ec4-8869-3fb67406fa37"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Kernels de la poda", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"bb1c16c9-7a98-4c39-b6c0-28c79684f837"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Sucesor", " ", "de", " ", "cada", " ", "configuracion", " ", 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{"ECA", ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"frontera", " ", "periodica"}]}], ")"}], " ", "y", " ", 
    "reinicio", " ", "de", " ", 
    RowBox[{"pend", "/", "acc"}]}], " ", "*)"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"kSucc", "=", 
     RowBox[{"cudaFn", "[", 
      RowBox[{"Function", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"Typed", "[", 
           RowBox[{"succ", ",", 
            RowBox[{"\"\<CArray\>\"", "::[", "\"\<Integer32\>\"", "]"}]}], 
           "]"}], ",", 
          RowBox[{"Typed", "[", 
           RowBox[{"pend", ",", 
            RowBox[{"\"\<CArray\>\"", "::[", "\"\<Integer32\>\"", "]"}]}], 
           "]"}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "    ", 
          RowBox[{"Typed", "[", 
           RowBox[{"acc", ",", 
            RowBox[{"\"\<CArray\>\"", "::[", "\"\<Integer64\>\"", "]"}]}], 
           "]"}], ",", 
          RowBox[{"Typed", "[", 
           RowBox[{"rule", ",", "\"\<MachineInteger\>\""}], "]"}], ",", 
          RowBox[{"Typed", "[", 
           RowBox[{"n", ",", "\"\<MachineInteger\>\""}], "]"}], ",", 
          RowBox[{"Typed", "[", 
           RowBox[{"total", ",", "\"\<MachineInteger\>\""}], "]"}]}], "}"}], ",",
         "\[IndentingNewLine]", "   ", 
        RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{
           "id", ",", "x", ",", "mask", ",", "l", ",", "r", ",", "nx", ",", 
            "a", ",", "b", ",", "c"}], "}"}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
          "    ", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"id", "=", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{
               "LibraryFunction", "[", "\"\<BlockDimensions.x\>\"", "]"}], "[",
                "]"}], "*", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"LibraryFunction", "[", "\"\<BlockID.x\>\"", "]"}], "[",
                "]"}]}], "+", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"LibraryFunction", "[", "\"\<ThreadID.x\>\"", "]"}], "[",
               "]"}]}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "    ", 
           RowBox[{"If", "[", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"id", "<", "total"}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
             "     ", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"x", "=", 
               RowBox[{"Cast", "[", 
                RowBox[{
                "id", ",", "\"\<UnsignedInteger64\>\"", 
                 ",", "\"\<CCast\>\""}], "]"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
              "     ", 
              RowBox[{"mask", "=", 
               RowBox[{"Cast", "[", 
                RowBox[{
                 RowBox[{"total", "-", "1"}], ",", "\"\<UnsignedInteger64\>\"",
                  ",", "\"\<CCast\>\""}], "]"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]",
               "     ", 
              RowBox[{"l", "=", 
               RowBox[{"BitAnd", "[", 
                RowBox[{
                 RowBox[{"BitOr", "[", 
                  RowBox[{
                   RowBox[{"BitShiftRight", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"x", ",", "1"}], "]"}], ",", 
                   RowBox[{"BitShiftLeft", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"x", ",", 
                    RowBox[{"n", "-", "1"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}], ",", "mask"}], 
                "]"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "     ", 
              RowBox[{"r", "=", 
               RowBox[{"BitAnd", "[", 
                RowBox[{
                 RowBox[{"BitOr", "[", 
                  RowBox[{
                   RowBox[{"BitShiftLeft", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"x", ",", "1"}], "]"}], ",", 
                   RowBox[{"BitShiftRight", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"x", ",", 
                    RowBox[{"n", "-", "1"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}], ",", "mask"}], 
                "]"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "     ", 
              RowBox[{"nx", "=", 
               RowBox[{"Cast", "[", 
                RowBox[{
                "0", ",", "\"\<UnsignedInteger64\>\"", ",", "\"\<CCast\>\""}],
                 "]"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "     ", 
              RowBox[{"Do", "[", 
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"If", "[", 
                 RowBox[{
                  RowBox[{
                   RowBox[{"BitAnd", "[", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"BitShiftRight", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"rule", ",", "v"}], "]"}], ",", "1"}], "]"}], "==",
                    "1"}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "       ", 
                  RowBox[{
                   RowBox[{"a", "=", 
                    RowBox[{"If", "[", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"BitAnd", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"v", ",", "4"}], "]"}], "!=", "0"}], ",", "l", ",", 
                    RowBox[{"BitXor", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"l", ",", "mask"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", 
                   "\[IndentingNewLine]", "       ", 
                   RowBox[{"b", "=", 
                    RowBox[{"If", "[", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"BitAnd", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"v", ",", "2"}], "]"}], "!=", "0"}], ",", "x", ",", 
                    RowBox[{"BitXor", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"x", ",", "mask"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", 
                   "\[IndentingNewLine]", "       ", 
                   RowBox[{"c", "=", 
                    RowBox[{"If", "[", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"BitAnd", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"v", ",", "1"}], "]"}], "!=", "0"}], ",", "r", ",", 
                    RowBox[{"BitXor", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"r", ",", "mask"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", 
                   "\[IndentingNewLine]", "       ", 
                   RowBox[{"nx", "=", 
                    RowBox[{"BitOr", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"nx", ",", 
                    RowBox[{"BitAnd", "[", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"BitAnd", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"a", ",", "b"}], "]"}], ",", "c"}], "]"}]}], 
                    "]"}]}]}]}], "]"}], ",", 
                RowBox[{"{", 
                 RowBox[{"v", ",", "0", ",", "7"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], ";", 
              "\[IndentingNewLine]", "     ", 
              RowBox[{"ToRawPointer", "[", 
               RowBox[{"succ", ",", "id", ",", 
                RowBox[{"Cast", "[", 
                 RowBox[{
                 "nx", ",", "\"\<Integer32\>\"", ",", "\"\<CCast\>\""}], 
                 "]"}]}], "]"}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "     ", 
              RowBox[{"ToRawPointer", "[", 
               RowBox[{"pend", ",", "id", ",", 
                RowBox[{"Cast", "[", 
                 RowBox[{
                 "0", ",", "\"\<Integer32\>\"", ",", "\"\<CCast\>\""}], 
                 "]"}]}], "]"}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "     ", 
              RowBox[{"ToRawPointer", "[", 
               RowBox[{"acc", ",", "id", ",", 
                RowBox[{"Cast", "[", 
                 RowBox[{
                 "0", ",", "\"\<Integer64\>\"", ",", "\"\<CCast\>\""}], 
                 "]"}]}], "]"}]}]}], "]"}], ";"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}], "]"}]}], 
    ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
    RowBox[{"Grado", " ", "de", " ", "entrada"}], " ", "*)"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"kDeg", "=", 
     RowBox[{"cudaFn", "[", 
      RowBox[{"Function", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"Typed", "[", 
           RowBox[{"succ", ",", 
            RowBox[{"\"\<CArray\>\"", "::[", "\"\<Integer32\>\"", "]"}]}], 
           "]"}], ",", 
          RowBox[{"Typed", "[", 
           RowBox[{"pend", ",", 
            RowBox[{"\"\<CArray\>\"", "::[", "\"\<Integer32\>\"", "]"}]}], 
           "]"}], ",", 
          RowBox[{"Typed", "[", 
           RowBox[{"total", ",", "\"\<MachineInteger\>\""}], "]"}]}], "}"}], ",",
         "\[IndentingNewLine]", "   ", 
        RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"{", "id", "}"}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "    ", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"id", "=", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{
               "LibraryFunction", "[", "\"\<BlockDimensions.x\>\"", "]"}], "[",
                "]"}], "*", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"LibraryFunction", "[", "\"\<BlockID.x\>\"", "]"}], "[",
                "]"}]}], "+", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"LibraryFunction", "[", "\"\<ThreadID.x\>\"", "]"}], "[",
               "]"}]}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "    ", 
           RowBox[{"If", "[", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"id", "<", "total"}], ",", 
             RowBox[{"Compile`AtomicUpdate", "[", 
              RowBox[{"pend", ",", 
               RowBox[{"FromRawPointer", "[", 
                RowBox[{"succ", ",", "id"}], "]"}], ",", "\"\<Plus\>\"", ",", 
               
               RowBox[{"Cast", "[", 
                RowBox[{"1", ",", "\"\<Integer32\>\"", ",", "\"\<CCast\>\""}],
                 "]"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}], ";"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}], "]"}]}], 
    ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
    RowBox[{"Cola", " ", 
     RowBox[{"inicial", ":", " ", 
      RowBox[{"Jardines", " ", "del", " ", "Eden"}]}]}], " ", "*)"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"kSeed", "=", 
     RowBox[{"cudaFn", "[", 
      RowBox[{"Function", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"Typed", "[", 
           RowBox[{"pend", ",", 
            RowBox[{"\"\<CArray\>\"", "::[", "\"\<Integer32\>\"", "]"}]}], 
           "]"}], ",", 
          RowBox[{"Typed", "[", 
           RowBox[{"q", ",", 
            RowBox[{"\"\<CArray\>\"", "::[", "\"\<Integer32\>\"", "]"}]}], 
           "]"}], ",", 
          RowBox[{"Typed", "[", 
           RowBox[{"cnt", ",", 
            RowBox[{"\"\<CArray\>\"", "::[", "\"\<Integer32\>\"", "]"}]}], 
           "]"}], ",", 
          RowBox[{"Typed", "[", 
           RowBox[{"total", ",", "\"\<MachineInteger\>\""}], "]"}]}], "}"}], ",",
         "\[IndentingNewLine]", "   ", 
        RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"id", ",", "i"}], "}"}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
          "    ", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"id", "=", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{
               "LibraryFunction", "[", "\"\<BlockDimensions.x\>\"", "]"}], "[",
                "]"}], "*", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"LibraryFunction", "[", "\"\<BlockID.x\>\"", "]"}], "[",
                "]"}]}], "+", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"LibraryFunction", "[", "\"\<ThreadID.x\>\"", "]"}], "[",
               "]"}]}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "    ", 
           RowBox[{"If", "[", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{
